          <p class="text-xs text-text-light">i105E, H500E och H800E, GPS utan perimeterkabel.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/dreame-robotgrasklippare/" class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-border p-5 hover:border-accent transition-colors group">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-text group-hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-1">Dreame robotgräsklippare</h3>
